Package: mesale-play
Version: @BUILD@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Mesale OS <mesale@localhost>
Section: games
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-manette-0.2
Description: Mesale Play: installed Steam, Heroic and Lutris games in one fullscreen library
 Reads each launcher's local files (no accounts) and starts games through it.
 Works with gamepads (libmanette) and the keyboard.
